WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.101
- [Kelly] You did get to meet
Priscilla Presley, right?

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.330
- [Austin] Yeah.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.560
- What was that like?

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.771
Was it intimidating?

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:07.560
- Super intimidating,

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.690
but she didn't make it intimidating.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:10.950
I met her the same day

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.720
I went to Grayson for the first time.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:13.560
- I've never been.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.393
- [Austin] You've never been?

00:00:14.393 --> 00:00:16.560
- No! And I lived
Tennessee for like years.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.000
I just don't know, work.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.678
- Yeah, it's so great.

00:00:19.678 --> 00:00:21.610
Baz and I took this road trip

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.810
right after I got the part.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.050
We went and recorded in Nashville,

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.056
it was the first recording
studio I was ever in,

00:00:30.056 --> 00:00:30.889
- It's a great place to record.

00:00:30.889 --> 00:00:32.289
- It was RCA Studio B there.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.010
Where Dolly Parton recorded Jolene.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:35.843
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:35.843 --> 00:00:38.888
- Elvis recorded over
270 songs, I believe.

00:00:38.888 --> 00:00:40.770
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.220
- So we took this road trip
and ended up in Grayson

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.990
and next door there was this hotel

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:47.880
where I met Priscilla,

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.100
and she was just so beautiful

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.260
and so warm and welcoming.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.880
And she just gave me a big hug

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.620
and said, you have a lot of support.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.960
And I walked out of that hotel room

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.100
just with tears in my eyes.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:04.100
Just thinking, it's amazing
when you look into her eyes

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:07.680
and you you think this is the same woman

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.960
that Elvis was madly in love with.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.240
That she was madly in love with him.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.610
She's the mother of his only child,

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:16.200
and then she's right here in front of me.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.363
It's really surreal.

00:01:18.363 --> 00:01:20.430
We got to go to the MET Gala recently

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.710
and we kind of danced a bit,

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:24.930
and she's the best, she's incredible.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:25.920
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.450
You seem very present.

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.680
Are you always that present

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:30.090
in thinking like that?

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:30.923
In life?

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:32.220
Like, you know, just being
in the moment like that,

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:33.481
not people many people are like that.

00:01:33.481 --> 00:01:36.600
- I try to be, it's hard
with what we do sometimes.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.109
- I'm working at it and I
just turned 40 Austin, so-

00:01:39.109 --> 00:01:39.942
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:39.942 --> 00:01:40.775
- Well, you look amazing.

00:01:40.775 --> 00:01:41.769
- Well, thank you for lying.

00:01:41.769 --> 00:01:43.740
(audience laugh)

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.360
but thank you so much, Austin.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:46.740
Everybody, we need another break.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:49.200
Go see Elvis, it's in theaters tomorrow.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.487
You won't regret it!

